          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "పరిమాణం (parimāṇaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit parimāṇa, \"measure, size, quantity\" (Monier-Williams), from pari-mā, \"to measure out\"."
            }
